  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "做伙來唸詩 - Sio-tn̄g有詩"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "\n<div class=\"tg-article\" style=\"color: #333333; font-family: &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0px auto; max-width: 800px;\">\n    <h1 style=\"color: black; font-size: 36px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px; text-align: center;\">Sio-tn̄g有詩</h1>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n        <p style=\"color: #555555; font-size: 20px; margin: 0px;\">/ 林榮淑</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-images\">\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEidwQ90FpC3kwOD5Ahyrnz8m_CbRyALrF9xgoJwim_WMqzjRSEeJfuqsaFMU77PlWQUCZvJ2pArmRLNpKHHVDIKOH9Vxo9b_MzR5MQYDILjtCtVBACKC5UWDRgRnn0X4NIQbGMdjgSy24jWJzI98-RFqmDv2hvsgOX8dIQmDQo0hfxGt5SwmzK2n2rl8oEH\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" /></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-content\" style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 30px; padding: 0px 10px; text-align: justify;\">\n        港都愛河灣<br />透黃飽tīnn光iànn溫暖<br />無聲無sueh　泅來泅去<br />大隻鴨bî仔kài古錐<br />Ná無ná有sio唚tsiok心適<br />牽tiâu島嶼眾人感情線<br /><br />十年歲月<br />阮囝大漢　我變老 \t<br />時間溜suan<br />你講ná你講<br />原在古錐款<br />高雄港sio拄tn̄g<br /> <br />Tsông出tsông入lo̍k-kho̍k馬<br />影著透年無煩無惱<br />規工恬恬仔水中遊<br />Ak-tsak ê心<br />\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>聊聊仔<br />\t\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>勻勻仔<br />\t\t\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>坐清<br /><br />徛暝日sio-ián世界<br />受傷ê空喙khuann-khuann仔收束<br />浮沉人生<br />化--去ê ǹg望重koh點to̍h<br />看無情ê時間擋恬<br />無限ê想像自由leh飛<br /><br />黃色大隻鴨bî仔<br />Sio-tn̄g m̄-thang隔十年<br />\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tg-annotations\" style=\"border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; border-top: 1px solid #ddd; color: #666666; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 60px; padding: 15px 10px 0px;\">編註：「黃色大隻鴨bî仔」是荷蘭藝術家Florentijn Hofman創作ê作品，英語一般叫Giant Rubber Duck、華語叫『黃色小鴨』。Tī高雄bat展出兩擺，第一擺是2013/9/19～2013/10/20 tī光榮碼頭，第二擺是2024/1/27～2024/2/25 tī愛河灣（tsit擺展出兩隻鴨bî仔），兩擺拄好隔十年外。</div>\n\n    <div class=\"donation-section\" style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); margin-top: 40px; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <div style=\"width: 100%;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjrKYoXj_wJUTBPNsu8d3MYYKNtLRX5xKPGaZn5mDxlhszDdwK5pfUju_FzwHQyamnz6XfIfoltdTkXQxs0L0IB-lOe4XUsmJ_gEfjJp1DMrMlC0ipugio_S0ObqohWlgLov0Bc07xLvv1qnED4d0IdAxEEgIsBXmUKlKQuB7DFec3bMDJhXZQkORLsl94N\" style=\"display: block; width: 100%;\" /></div>\n        <div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; padding: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n            <div style=\"font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n                <b><span style=\"color: #3778cd;\">#台文通訊BONG報</span> 382期，2026年01月出刊。</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會</div>\n            <div style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 16px;\">\n                線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a><br />\n                線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 15px;\">\n                郵政劃撥：19021486 / 戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會<br />\n                電匯：123-20-050514-2 (華南銀行士林分行)\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 15px; text-align: justify;\">\n                #李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
  },
